                      "expr": {
                        "text": "var P = thisComp.layer(\"Controls\").effect(\"Position\")(\"Point\"); var mw = thisComp.width * thisComp.layer(\"Controls\").effect(\"Max Width\")(\"Slider\") / 100; var tl = thisComp.layer(\"Text\"); var r = tl.sourceRectAtTime(time, false); var fs = tl.text.sourceText.style.fontSize; var hs = thisComp.layer(\"Controls\").effect(\"Heart Size\")(\"Slider\") / 100 * fs; var gap = 0.45 * fs; var full = r.width + 2 * (gap + hs); var f = full > mw ? mw / full : 1; [f * 100, f * 100, 100]",
